OL,3,GNEWSATeacher murder accused sped away
OL,4,Afrom police, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA man accused of killing a head teacher
OL,10,Fby driving for more than a mile with
OL,11,Fthe victim trapped under his car was
OL,12,Ftackled to the ground by a police
OL,13,Fofficer the next day.
OL,15,FSimon Richardson, 35, was arrested on
OL,16,F21 April, the day after his black Volvo
OL,17,FXC90 crashed into 56-year-old Michael
OL,18,FMullins at a junction in Warburton,
OL,19,FTrafford.
