OL,3,GNEWSATeacher murder accused sped away
OL,4,Afrom police, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FMullins, who had been cycling home from
OL,7,FStretford Grammar School, was dragged
OL,8,Fat speeds of over 60mph (97km/h) before
OL,9,Fhe finally came loose on a country lane
OL,10,Fin Lymm, Cheshire, where he died a
OL,11,Fshort time later.
